<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Bulletin Hebdomadaire des Marchés Vivriers — Ketrika</title>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4 portrait;
      margin: 20mm 15mm 20mm 15mm;
      @bottom-right {
        content: "Page " counter(page) " sur " counter(pages);
        font-size: 9pt;
        color: #64748b;
      }
      @bottom-left {
        content: "Ketrika Agri Market Intelligence Madagascar • Données 100% vérifiables";
        font-size: 8pt;
        color: #94a3b8;
      }
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #0f172a;
      background: #ffffff;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-size: 10.5pt;
    }
    .header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #047857;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .brand {
      font-size: 20pt;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #064e3b;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 10pt;
      color: #047857;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .period-box {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 8pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: #047857;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      float: right;
    }
    h1, h2, h3 {
      color: #0f172a;
      page-break-after: avoid;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 13pt;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #064e3b;
    }
    p {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    ul {
      margin-top: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    li {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    strong {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .facts-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 9pt;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    .facts-table th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #334155;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .facts-table td {
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-left: 3px solid #047857;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      color: #475569;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <span class="badge">Données Certifiées Gold</span>
    <div class="brand">KETRIKA</div>
    <div class="subtitle">Agri Market Intelligence Madagascar</div>
    <div class="period-box">
      <strong>Bulletin de Veille PPN Vivriers</strong> • Période du {{ period_start }} au {{ period_end }}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    {{ html_body | safe }}
  </div>

  <h2>Tableau Récapitulatif des Faits Certifiés</h2>
  <table class="facts-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 12%;">Code</th>
        <th style="width: 58%;">Indicateur de Marché</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Valeur Observée (Display)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for k, f in facts.items() %}
      {% if k != "sources_attribution" %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ k }}</code></td>
        <td>{{ f.label }}</td>
        <td><strong>{{ f.display }}</strong></td>
      </tr>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  {% if facts.get('sources_attribution') %}
  <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 8.5pt; color: #475569;">
    <strong>Sources officielles auditées :</strong> {{ facts['sources_attribution'].display }}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="footer-note">
    <strong>Garantie de Traçabilité Totale :</strong> Aucun chiffre présenté dans cette publication n'a été produit librement par une intelligence artificielle. 100 % des valeurs proviennent des séries Gold officielles (ODR, MinCC, INSTAT, WFP, Douanes).
  </div>
</body>
</html>
